{
  "name": "navhub",
  "private": true,
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "type": "module",
  "packageManager": "pnpm@11.7.0",
  "//engines": "基线运行时 Node 24 LTS：CI 与全部 Docker 镜像均为 node:24-bookworm-slim；原生 TypeScript strip-types 自 Node 22.18 起默认开启，已无需 --experimental-strip-types 实验标志。pnpm 由 packageManager 锁定，这里再声明下限防止 corepack 缺失时被旧版安装。",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=24.0.0",
    "pnpm": ">=11.7.0"
  },
  "//seed": "必须以仓库根目录为 CWD 运行：config.ts 的 NAVHUB_SQLITE_PATH 默认值是 cwd 相对的 ./data/navhub.db，而 dev-all/Docker 用的是仓库根的 data/navhub.db。此前 `pnpm --filter @navhub/api seed` 以 apps/api 为 CWD，把种子播进了 apps/api/data/navhub.db——开发服务器永远看不到，市场因此像空壳。",
  "//coverage": "覆盖率硬门禁（W1）：跑全量测试并按 coverage-thresholds.json 判定全局+分区域 floor，另加 --max-age 防陈旧产物假绿。阈值收紧只改那一份文件并走独立 PR（docs/TESTING-STRATEGY.md §3.3）。",
  "scripts": {
    "build": "pnpm -r --filter \"@navhub/*\" build",
    "dev": "node apps/api/src/main.ts",
    "dev:all": "node scripts/dev-all.mjs",
    "dev:web": "node scripts/run.mjs --filter navsphere dev",
    "test": "vitest run --reporter=default --reporter=./scripts/vitest-github-reporter.mjs",
    "test:watch": "vitest",
    "test:e2e": "playwright test",
    "coverage": "vitest run --coverage && node scripts/check-coverage.mjs --thresholds coverage-thresholds.json --max-age 60",
    "typecheck": "node scripts/typecheck.mjs",
    "typecheck:web": "node scripts/check-frontend-typecheck.mjs",
    "typecheck:video": "node scripts/typecheck-video-scope.mjs",
    "video:catalog": "node apps/api/src/video-catalog-main.ts",
    "video:catalog:check": "node apps/api/src/video-catalog-main.ts --check",
    "site:heal": "node scripts/self-healing-agent.mjs",
    "site:heal:check": "node scripts/self-healing-agent.mjs --dry-run",
    "seed": "node apps/api/src/seed-main.ts",
    "mcp:stdio": "pnpm --filter @navhub/mcp start",
    "vendor:web": "node scripts/vendor-web.mjs",
    "nav:baseline": "node scripts/gen-nav-baseline.mts",
    "//load:seed": "压测种子：必须显式 NAVHUB_SQLITE_PATH 指向隔离库；--fresh 只删 loadtest*.db（规划 P2 压测基线）",
    "load:seed": "node scripts/seed-loadtest.mts",
    "load:baseline": "node scripts/load-baseline.mts",
    "test:pg": "node scripts/pg-check.mts",
    "//test:pg:suite": "跨方言套件的显式入口：未设置 NAVHUB_TEST_DATABASE_URL 直接失败，避免「以为跑了 PG 实际全 skip」。",
    "test:pg:suite": "node scripts/run-pg-suite.mjs",
    "check:overlay": "node scripts/generate-web-mirror.mjs && node scripts/check-web-overlay.mjs",
    "check:hub-policy": "node scripts/gen-hub-route-policy.mjs --check",
    "gen:hub-policy": "node scripts/gen-hub-route-policy.mjs",
    "check:rest-contracts": "node scripts/generate-rest-contract-types.mjs --check && node scripts/check-rest-contract-coverage.mjs",
    "gen:rest-contracts": "node scripts/generate-rest-contract-types.mjs",
    "gen:overlay-baseline": "node scripts/gen-overlay-baseline.mjs",
    "check:ci-gate": "node scripts/check-ci-gate.mjs",
    "check:refs": "node scripts/check-committed-refs.mjs",
    "check:boundaries": "node scripts/check-import-boundaries.mjs",
    "check:vendored": "node scripts/sync-vendored.mjs --check",
    "test:telemetry": "node scripts/test-telemetry.mjs",
    "doctor": "node scripts/doctor.mjs",
    "ci:status": "node scripts/ci-status.mjs",
    "ci:logs": "node scripts/ci-status.mjs --logs",
    "typecheck:why": "node scripts/typecheck-attribution.mjs",
    "repro": "node scripts/repro-ci.mjs",
    "check:contracts": "node scripts/check-component-contracts.mjs",
    "commit-safe": "node scripts/commit-safe.mjs",
    "ci:explain": "node scripts/explain-ci-failure.mjs",
    "ci:thickness": "node scripts/check-defused-thickness.mjs",
    "check:bundle": "node scripts/check-bundle-budget.mjs",
    "check:extensions": "node scripts/check-extensions.mjs",
    "seo:audit": "node scripts/seo-audit.mjs",
    "seo:html-budget": "node scripts/html-budget.mjs",
    "seo:indexnow": "node scripts/indexnow.mjs",
    "lint": "pnpm --filter navsphere lint",
    "//lint:backend": "后端静态检查（P1-8）：三条规则已是 error 级 + --max-warnings 0，`pnpm verify` 与 CI 的 lint:backend 步骤都阻断（那步的 continue-on-error 于 2026-11-01 撤掉）。阻塞作业里另有 apps/api/test/backend-lint-gate.test.ts 跑同一份配置并给逐条明细，这条配对由 scripts/check-ci-gate.mjs 第 5 项守住。",
    "lint:backend": "pnpm --filter @navhub/api --filter @navhub/store run lint",
    "backup": "node scripts/backup.mjs",
    "backup:verify": "node scripts/db-backup-verify.mjs",
    "rehearse:db": "node scripts/db-rehearse.mjs",
    "eval:search": "node scripts/search-eval.mts",
    "prepare": "node scripts/install-git-hooks.mjs",
    "verify": "node scripts/verify.mjs",
    "verify:full": "node scripts/verify.mjs --full",
    "verify:web": "node scripts/vendor-web.mjs && pnpm --filter navsphere exec tsc --noEmit && pnpm --filter navsphere exec eslint .",
    "verify:all": "node scripts/verify.mjs --full && pnpm lint && playwright test",
    "verify:guards": "node scripts/verify-guard.mjs --all",
    "video:catalog:reconcile": "node apps/api/src/video-catalog-main.ts --check --json",
    "mirror:web": "node scripts/generate-web-mirror.mjs"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@playwright/test": "^1.64.1",
    "@types/node": "^24.0.0",
    "@vitest/coverage-v8": "5.0.5",
    "esbuild": ">=0.28.1",
    "typescript": "5.9.3",
    "typescript7": "npm:typescript@7.0.2",
    "vitest": "5.0.5"
  }
}
